{"title":"Lesson 02 · I Have Two Younger Brothers 我有兩個弟弟","short":"L02 兩個弟弟 · prep","kick":"Let’s Learn Mandarin 來！學華語 · Book 1 · Lesson 2 · topic: family · prep for class with Chunhua (Tue Nov 3, 5 PM ET)","h1":"Lesson 02 · I Have Two Younger Brothers <span>我有兩個弟弟</span>","key":"<span class=\"real\">REAL textbook clip</span> = the textbook’s own recording, cut per line / per word with our audio_chop tool (each cut re-checked by a second transcription). <span class=\"syn\">▶ synthetic</span> = a computer voice (edge-tts, Taiwan voices HsiaoChen / YunJhe), used only where the textbook has no recording. Trust the real tracks when they differ.","foot":"Dialogue, vocab, grammar, pinyin focus: Let’s Learn Mandarin Book 1 textbook pp. 013-024 (Lesson 2). English translations, ‘Your turn’ lines, quiz and [ours] notes are ours, not the textbook’s. The textbook’s Text track repeats the dialogue at the same speed with pauses (‘Now it’s your turn’), so there is no separate slow pass to offer. Synthetic clips are not from the textbook.","emoji":"📘","color":"#3B5BDB","subtitle":"Let's Learn Mandarin B1 · family","id":"lm_b1_l02","kind":"textbook","source":"Textbook: Let's Learn Mandarin Book 1","sections":[{"type":"tracks","title":"Textbook audio · real recordings","items":[{"label":"B1-L02-1-Text (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T1-Text.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L02-1-Text","real":true}]},{"label":"B1-L02-2-Vocabulary (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T2-Vocabulary.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L02-2-Vocabulary","real":true}]},{"label":"B1-L02-3-Grammar (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T3-Grammar.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L02-3-Grammar","real":true}]},{"label":"B1-L02-4-Pinyin (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T4-Pinyin.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L02-4-Pinyin","real":true}]}]},{"type":"lines","title":"Dialogue","zh":{"t":"課文","s":"课文"},"kick":"tap a line · G = Gloria Lee (woman) · 明 = 王明文 (man)","items":[{"id":"d1","spk":"G","g":"f","en":"Mingwen, hi.","cells":[{"ch":"明","py":"Míng","t":2,"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"]]},{"ch":"文","py":"wén","t":2,"fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"],["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]],"pz":"，"},{"ch":"你","py":"nǐ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ní"},{"ch":"好","py":"hǎo","t":3,"mk":["h","~","#E67700"],"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"chip":"-ng","lab":"míng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"},{"chip":"-n","lab":"wén","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"wén","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǐ hǎo","cue":"3+3: say ní hǎo","kind":"33"},{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d1.mp3","label":"明文，你好。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d2","spk":"明","g":"m","en":"Hi, Gloria.","cells":[{"ch":"妳","py":"Nǐ","t":3,"s":"你","mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ní"},{"ch":"好","py":"hǎo","t":3,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"Gloria","py":"Gloria","lat":1},{"pu":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǐ hǎo","cue":"3+3: say ní hǎo","kind":"33"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d2.mp3","label":"妳好，Gloria。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d3","spk":"G","g":"f","en":"Mingwen, do you have siblings?","cells":[{"ch":"明","py":"Míng","t":2},{"ch":"文","py":"wén","t":2,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"你","py":"nǐ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ní"},{"ch":"有","py":"yǒu","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"]},{"ch":"兄","py":"xiōng","t":1,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"弟","py":"dì","t":4,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐","mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"妹","py":"mèi","t":4},{"ch":"嗎","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"吗","pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sy